### Step 6: Compute the distance from $ \mathbf{u} $ to the span

The distance from $ \mathbf{u} $ to the span is given by:

$$
\| \mathbf{u} - \text{proj}_{\text{span}\{\mathbf{v}_1, \mathbf{v}_2\}} \mathbf{u} \|
$$

